{"schema_version":3,"seq":44,"timestamp_ms":1792446669558,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened five follow-up tickets, one per affected component of INC-2291. I also commented on the incident ticket (#323) and set it to `resolved`. A final search on the `followup` label returned exactly these five tickets.\n\nTeam owners come from the open ownership ticket (#325). The closed 2025 table (#324) is superseded and lists `session-store` under `platform`, so I didn't use it.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | `payments-api` | billing |\n| #327 | `edge-proxy` | platform |\n| #328 | `session-store` | identity |\n| #329 | `events-pipeline` | data |\n| #330 | `notify-service` | platform |\n\nAll five are `P2` with the `followup` label. The comment on #323 lists them as `#326` through `#330`. I changed no other tickets.\n\nI wrote `/app/STATUS.json` with status `success`.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
